WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
A lot of late night hosts out there,

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.800
they do it the same way.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.150
They come out and they
tell some monologue jokes.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.450
Okay, and they all do
it just like everybody.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.060
Not this guy, I like to innovate.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.500
Sorry, other hosts, but
that's the way I roll.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.900
I'm Conan the Innovator, a
name that never caught on.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:25.900
Anyway, I've found a great
way to tell topical jokes

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.163
that also adds excitement and sex appeal.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.400
Check this out, in North
Carolina, president Trump

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.190
told supporters to vote twice,
once by mail, once in person.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:41.693
Trump said, it's crucial
that I win both elections.

00:00:42.771 --> 00:00:45.021
♪ Conan's lighting up the darkness ♪

00:00:45.021 --> 00:00:47.309
♪ Fighting fascists and their lies ♪

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:52.309
♪ All the people will rejoice
when Donald Trump cries ♪

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.850
Um, what was that?

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:57.683
What are you talking about?

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:00.810
I'm fighting fascism with my jokes, Andy.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.510
Hey, it's come out that Melania Trump

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:07.150
used her own private email
to conduct official business.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.550
Isn't that shocking?

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.805
Melania Trump has official business.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.932
♪ Set-up-punch means devastation ♪

00:01:13.932 --> 00:01:16.232
♪ Conan set the world on fire ♪

00:01:16.232 --> 00:01:17.992
♪ Humor, pathos, and insight ♪

00:01:17.992 --> 00:01:22.132
♪ There's no art form higher ♪

00:01:22.132 --> 00:01:24.600
I'm sorry, but I don't think these jokes

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.950
deserve this much fanfare.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.660
Well, you're wrong.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.640
This week, Grey's Anatomy will begin

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:33.570
filming it's 17th season, yeah.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.320
The big change is that now
Grey's Anatomy is named

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.718
after the cast's hair color.

00:01:38.718 --> 00:01:40.792
♪ Conan's really on a roll now ♪

00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:43.167
♪ Zinging targets left and right ♪

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:44.902
♪ Going after Hollywood ♪

00:01:44.902 --> 00:01:49.507
♪ He's fighting the good fight ♪

00:01:49.507 --> 00:01:52.680
Oh, I hope you don't get
canceled for that one.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.010
In a recent speech, the pope urged people

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.810
to live a simpler, more austere life.

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.470
Yeah, then he took off
his diamond-studded hat

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.532
and went back into his palace.

00:02:02.532 --> 00:02:04.905
♪ Conan joked about the pope ♪

00:02:04.905 --> 00:02:07.255
♪ I don't know if that's okay ♪

00:02:07.255 --> 00:02:12.255
♪ But I'll sing most anything
as long as they pay ♪

00:02:13.516 --> 00:02:17.455
Okay, your '80s singer's
getting kind of lazy now.

00:02:17.455 --> 00:02:20.660
Well, forget that.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.493
He's going to be great.

00:02:21.493 --> 00:02:23.950
He's going to really get it with this one.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.140
One more, at a zoo in Thailand,

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.340
a visitor was caught
fondling a Tiger's testicles.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.270
Yeah, after hearing about it,

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:33.913
tigers in the wild began
turning themselves in.

00:02:34.992 --> 00:02:37.142
♪ Sha na na na na na doo doo ♪

00:02:37.142 --> 00:02:39.505
♪ Rocky rock rock sing sing sing ♪

00:02:39.505 --> 00:02:41.440
♪ Sorry, wasn't paying attention ♪

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.440
♪ Checking my email ♪

00:02:46.842 --> 00:02:49.100
How was that, Andy?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:52.270
Oh, I'm sorry. I was, I
was checking my email.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:55.080
Oh, okay. Anyway, we got
a terrific show tonight.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.710
Beth Stelling's going to be joining us.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.710
We'll take a break. We'll be right back.

00:02:59.555 --> 00:03:04.555
('80s rock music)
(leaf blower whirs)

